<section style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <div style="margin-top:28px">
    <details><summary>Is it really my voice?</summary><p>Yes. We clone your voice from a short recording, so the voice notes leads receive sound like you.</p></details>
